  "title": "Olson's Conjecture",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Conjecture If $a_1,a_2,\\ldots,a_{2n-1}$ is a sequence of elements from a multiplicative group of order $n$, then there exist $1 \\le j_1 < j_2 \\ldots < j_n \\le 2n-1$ so that $\\prod_{i=1}^n a_{j_i} = 1$.",
